{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3440a5604b514ffa1eb4b7997680ba9e71b94bbbd6c1c5886a452db2cfb48829", "ja": "（映画の大ヒットを受けて、上映後にキャストごとの\nイベントが開催されることになった。今日は翼の番だ）", "zh": "（电影大获成功后，决定在放映结束后分别为每位演员举办活动。今天轮到翼了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "eba2c43bd128f06e78421fcaa9d81e2f6bf1448a6531a9050e8e9a572caae64a", "ja": "はぁ……今日のイベント、大丈夫かな～？", "zh": "唉……今天的活动，没问题吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cb68f7a565cd4b88cf11279f521d63fee660d8fe5a3becd21ca1627fbebc1c9e", "ja": "お疲れ様、翼。どうしたんだ？\nなんだか元気がないように見えるけど。", "zh": "辛苦了，翼。怎么了？\n感觉你看起来没什么精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9e5de234d2553b5fbde3a955166631ce21d5ca3e2f42ea7c5c5dbcdfdcbb8ed2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、見てないんですか？\nSNSに書かれてる、映画の感想。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你还没看吗？\n社交平台上写的那些电影感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6d412deb526f8e17a24f4b8f6945775326b3da02c0d2d3490e7cf7c2eb13bf20", "ja": "わたし、映画の中では悪役じゃないですか。だから\n感想も、あんまりいいこと書かれてないんですよ～。", "zh": "我在电影里不是演反派嘛。所以\n大家的感想里，也没怎么写好话呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1005_p", "source_sha256": "de4358a3102cc00f434708cb8eb471018e4fe2376b653baa7daf740049185550", "ja": "なるほどな。\nそれでちょっと落ち込んでたのか。", "zh": "原来如此。\n所以才有点消沉啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "75f372ab2e542d26812f92e169c9de60cd7911e0c734ede308f674caa5ec9528", "ja": "お芝居してるときは、全然平気だったけど。\nひとりでステージに立って、大丈夫なのかなって……。", "zh": "演戏的时候倒是完全没事。可是，要一个人站上舞台，真的没问题吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9f004df7839a1c32c2d3ba1a74cd5e76a7245a3cd6219224e4384732874b4e45", "ja": "みんなわたしのこと、嫌いになっちゃったかも？\nそしたら今日のイベントも、来てくれないかも……。", "zh": "大家会不会已经讨厌我了？\n那样的话，今天的活动也可能不会来参加了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5c066f20ac00ad8bbb990a82778633352f52ed439db5c6aa1cff2f5f83577840", "ja": "う～ん、そこまで心配する必要ないと思うけど……\nまあ言葉で説明するより、見た方が早いか。", "zh": "嗯～我觉得没必要担心到那个地步吧……\n不过，比起用语言解释，还是亲眼看看更快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bca6e7edf3e76a6bf0da2bfa377145e5b11786073d888dc817efd62be8575a61", "ja": "え？　それってどういう……。", "zh": "诶？　那是什么意思……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1010_null", "source_sha256": "582ddfa9360593db7029afccbc63844d7318b23e0e94acadf0b02faca7184cc1", "ja": "午前の部、終了後……", "zh": "上午场结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "53b2ea8ce5f683e3e860e7a1299da321e3aac234c0b7241519110c2e7ba12bf8", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nお客さん、いっぱい来てましたね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n来了好多观众呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0550d6bdcde6aff9abf11a17125722ac9e86b0ee960d8d2bb8b4761d9ccb9df6", "ja": "みんな、わたしのアビーの演技を褒めてくれて……\nびっくりしちゃいました！", "zh": "大家都夸奖了我饰演阿比的演技……\n真是吓了我一跳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1013_p", "source_sha256": "475c48fed5b0b7fe5920e836f494177e9de8ea5af786515a9bdcdd6a8374ff5c", "ja": "だから言っただろ？　確かに、アビーは\n悪役側かもしれないけど……。", "zh": "所以我不是早就说了吗？阿比确实可能是反派那边的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2f23ffcaaf34c3767ae1bd6132c5c36fedeea79f766c0982064aa5333128272f", "ja": "それ以上に、翼の演技を褒める声が多かったんだよ。\nSNSでも、よくよく見れば見つかるはずだぞ？", "zh": "比起那些，称赞翼演技的声音更多哦。仔细看看社交媒体的话，应该也能找到不少吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8abf46e70d0e0e4477b447780d235c83ed4d8af50fd180e79cd7c2b25806c3b6", "ja": "あっ、うん……途中で見るのやめちゃってたかも。\n悪いことばっかり書かれてたらイヤだなって……。", "zh": "啊，嗯……我可能看到一半就不看了。要是上面净写些不好的话，我会不开心的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c72773c17a8fc63e4dfec2a3863c85352efdec7dcb93adee08a6bece357dc7ac", "ja": "ほら、これとか。「悪役の子の演技、すごく上手い！」\n「翼ちゃんって、こんな演技もできるんだ」って。", "zh": "你看，还有这种——“演反派的女孩，演得真好！”“原来翼也能演出这种感觉啊。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c33458462e0f83b0625182f674949204caec037f2ce1924d95b76be52f60a4e0", "ja": "わっ、ホントだ～！　こっちの人は、今回の映画で\nわたしのファンになってくれたんだって！", "zh": "哇，真的耶～！这边这位说，因为这次的电影成为我的粉丝了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b06ba0322fa7f855778bbffa9a24d1be6625adebe84f510c7eb514d97a0656f9", "ja": "わたしのことを応援してくれてる人って、\nこんなにたくさんいたんですね……！", "zh": "支持我的人，\n原来有这么多啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2c55b4c37f9d79acb836c3a48d913586a0daa01c3e8ab3c352a3dfd7192e7b1b", "ja": "それだけ、いい演技ができてたってことだよ。\n今日来てくれた人の数が、何よりの証明だな。", "zh": "这就说明，你的演技有多棒了。  \n今天到场的人数，就是最好的证明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b64dcf5db6d33d56c1ee1e3838a08f964524e4fc03a0ba4bb412d5565504057e", "ja": "えへへ、そっか。そんなふうに\n思ってもらえてるなんて、知らなかったな……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，这样啊。没想到你们竟然是这么想的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0434_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f07920ba8cf18e8847ac2fe8f02d8e1c3c57aece6108e94bba2a4c1c8e5e1645", "ja": "うん、なんだかすっごくやる気が出てきました！\nよ～しっ、午後の部もこの調子でがんばろ～っと♪", "zh": "嗯，总觉得干劲一下子十足了！\n好～下午的活动也要保持这个状态加油啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
